        {
          "text": "Mumwaka wabili wamwami Dariyo, mumwezi wamusanu aibili, mubuzuba bwamakumi obile abumwi bwamwezi, ijwi lya-Jehova lyakasika kumulomo wa-Hagai musinsimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
