        {
          "text": "Nekubaboobo koyumya moyo wako, O Zerubabeli, mbwaamba Jehova. Koyumya moyo wako, O Joshua mwana wa-Jehozadaki mupaizi mupati. Anywebo amuyumye myoyo yanu, nubantu boonse bacisi, mbwaamba Jehova, Amubeleke, nkaambo ndi anywebo, mbwaamba Jehova wamakamu, ",
          "type": "text",
