        {
          "text": "Bulemu busyaalizi bwaŋanda eyi buyooba bupati kwiinda bwakutaanguna, mbwaamba Jehova wamakamu, alimwi kubusena obuno njoopa luumuno, mbwaamba Jehova wamakamu.",
