        },
        {
          "text": "Mubuzuba bwamakumi obile aane mumwezi wamusanu aine mumwaka wabili wamwami Dariyo ijwi lya-Jehova lyakaboola kumulomo wa-Hagai musinsimi, lyakati, ",
