        },
        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova wamakamu. Buzya bapaizi mubuzyo oyu wamulao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na muntu ulabweza nyama iisalala munkomo yacikobela cakwe, alimwi ulagumya inkomo yakwe cinkwa na musinza na waini na mafuta niciba cilyo cimwi, sa cilasalala? Bapaizi bakavuwa kuti, Tacisalali pe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.19.11+NUM.19.12+NUM.19.13+NUM.19.14+NUM.19.15+NUM.19.16+NUM.19.17+NUM.19.18+NUM.19.19+NUM.19.20+NUM.19.21+NUM.19.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "My 19:11-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Hagai wakabuzya kuti, Pele na muntu ulisofweede nkaambo kakuguma mutunta, alimwi ulagumya cintu cili boobo, sa cilasofwaala? Bapaizi bakavuwa kuti, Ncobeni cilasofwaala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
